  "implementationOutline": [
    "GameModule 暴露唯一 Campaign Runtime Module。",
    "Module 建立独占 runtime lease，并在 lease 内创建、重置和销毁 PhaseManager、registry、Campaign Runner 与 Settlement/Hunt generations。",
    "Settlement/Hunt generations 通过引用 CAS 交换各自权威状态；事务结束后释放 detached 世代。",
    "Settlement/Hunt/Combat Session attach 到同一个 registry；GameManager 通过 lease 请求玩家阶段命令。"
  ],
